<title>USA: HLHK World Group sees EPS growth.</title>
<headline>HLHK World Group sees EPS growth.</headline>
<dateline>LAS VEGAS, Nev. 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>HLHK World Group said Thursday it expects to report per-share profit of $1.15 for 1997 and $4.60 for 1998 as card revenues in the Asian market continue to climb.</p>
<p>The company said its operations have been &quot;bolstered by a burgeoning Pacific Rim market, strategic alliances, potential acquisitions and mergers and the renewal of its investment banking agreement.&quot;</p>
</text>
